    "description": "This dataset includes physical measurements of individual plants representative of a variety of coastal vegetation communities in Collier County, FL between 2017-11-27 and 2017-12-02. Measurements included, but were not limited to, diameter at breast height, estimated canopy height, diameter and number of prop roots, and leaf area. Additional data files are point clouds of representative stands of coastal vegetation communities generated by a terrestrial laser scanner. Scans were collected between 2017-11-27 and 2017-12-02.",
